{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782840/extras/3fb696b6ee83a7799d1a6d9759cef05a.avif?t=1774121306\" alt=\"Find your perfect match. Merge. Repeat.\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782840/extras_big/3fb696b6ee83a7799d1a6d9759cef05a.webp?t=1774121306 width=1560 height=497 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mingle is a character-matching puzzle game where you move through a crowd to find your twin. After finding your match, you merge to become someone new, and the search continues until everyone is matched.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782840/extras/2f21c68fce13cbdeb411e1aa5afbe798.poster.avif?t=1774121306\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782840/extras/2f21c68fce13cbdeb411e1aa5afbe798.webm?t=1774121306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782840/extras/2f21c68fce13cbdeb411e1aa5afbe798.mp4?t=1774121306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782840/extras/85c7190f63619f729fcface88594752a.avif?t=1774121306\" alt=\"Hundred of minglers to meet\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782840/extras_big/85c7190f63619f729fcface88594752a.webp?t=1774121306 width=1560 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet hundreds of chatty little characters, each eager to tell you something strange. There are over 400 to collect!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782840/extras/669cbe777b0f29c7d1fe2f00c350e8ab.avif?t=1774121306\" alt=\"\"data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782840/extras_big/669cbe777b0f29c7d1fe2f00c350e8ab.webp?t=1774121306 width=1560 height=467 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782840/extras/7b256f557213c696b7dbe774da4dee1b.avif?t=1774121306\" alt=\"New twists in every level\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782840/extras_big/7b256f557213c696b7dbe774da4dee1b.webp?t=1774121306 width=1560 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level mixes up the rules. Some characters move super fast, some shrink away, some grow into trees, and others even copy your every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782840/extras/76083abae88abb77544207599222a413.poster.avif?t=1774121306\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782840/extras/76083abae88abb77544207599222a413.webm?t=1774121306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782840/extras/76083abae88abb77544207599222a413.mp4?t=1774121306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782840/extras/fa431bec3e4a7d4a40d7828e2052b4a1.avif?t=1774121306\" alt=\"Play with a friend\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782840/extras_big/fa431bec3e4a7d4a40d7828e2052b4a1.webp?t=1774121306 width=1560 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab a friend for 2 player local co-op. Work together to earn a perfect three-stars, while also competing to see who can get the most merges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782840/extras/a03e02620c3252fb18249fd142047139.avif?t=1774121306\" alt=\"Star rating with P1 9 merges, and P2 22 merges\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782840/extras_big/a03e02620c3252fb18249fd142047139.webp?t=1774121306 width=1560 height=452 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782840/extras/5825668efe3fd553a0f979fda10036c0.avif?t=1774121306\" alt=\"Features\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782840/extras_big/5825668efe3fd553a0f979fda10036c0.webp?t=1774121306 width=1560 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25ab\ufe0f 1-2 player couch co-op</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25ab\ufe0f 400+ characters to unlock</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25ab\ufe0f\ufe0f Unlockable wallpapers and challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25ab\ufe0f\ufe0f Easy to learn, tough to master with a three-star rating system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25ab\ufe0f\ufe0f Great for fans of hidden object and tile-matching games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782840/extras/9717eaa96ab9475b376d6ae6d621a0a6.poster.avif?t=1774121306\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.stea